        {
          "text": "HSÜ Ch'iu 徐釚 (T. 電發, H. 虹亭, 拙存, 楓江漁父), 1636–1708, poet, landscape painter and man of letters, was a native of Wu-chiang, Kiangsu. In 1679 he was summoned to Peking to take the special examination known as po-hsüeh hung-tz'ŭ (see under P'êng Sun-yü).",
